{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜、京都。\n2日間の握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！\n列が途切れなかったのに\n感動しました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにたくさんの人が\n握手しに来てくださるなんて\nもう幸せ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せいっぱい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日のフライング\nお祝いしてくださって\n本当に嬉しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日後あらためてごあいさつします^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼私服／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部はパーカー着てフードかぶって\nチャック締めてたから地味だった。\nというかシュールだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部5部はらしくないチュニックとか\nミニ丈とかブーツとか...\nバレンタイン意識！女子！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部はベレー帽なしで三つ編み\n4部はこんな感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはいつものまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさんはやっぱり\nこっちのが落ち着くかしら？\n私はこっちのが断然落ち着くけど笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22日のライブ行くよ！\nって報告してくださる方たくさんいて\n嬉しいなあ。楽しみにしててね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはる♡2013.2.17"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とちはるって顔がよく動くみたい。\n「うちら乃木坂一表情筋動くよね！」\nって話してたの笑\nだから今度表情筋対決したい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当美形なのよね！\nなんであんなきれいなん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書道上手は最近知ったけど他にも\n何か隠してるんじゃないかって\n興味しんしんなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってるときのちはるもだいすきよ。\n年下なのにお姉ちゃんみたいだよ笑\nおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼久しぶりにちゃんず／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木どこ2月生誕祭\nはずかしいけど見てね！\nあ、やっぱり見なくていいや！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日もがんばりまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/17/0497034/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}